abstract: "Release candidate for the deterministic routing decision layer of the M2A2 / MA2A ecosystem, including the C++20 routing hot path, Python/C++ parity, authenticated failure adaptation, deterministic rerouting, routing-quality evaluation, and a strict ownership boundary that leaves identity and transport in MA2A."
